sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Flask
    participant Auth as Authentication Module
    participant Monitoring as Monitoring Module
    participant Sla as SLA Agent
    participant Alert as Alert Agent
    participant SQLite
    participant Report as Report Module

    User->>Browser: Enter credentials
    Browser->>Flask: POST /api/auth/login
    Flask->>Auth: validate credentials
    Auth->>SQLite: SELECT user by username/email
    SQLite-->>Auth: user record
    Auth->>SQLite: UPDATE last_login
    SQLite-->>Auth: commit success
    Auth-->>Flask: access/refresh tokens
    Flask-->>Browser: 200 OK + JWT
    Browser-->>User: Show authenticated dashboard

    User->>Browser: Open monitoring view
    Browser->>Flask: GET /api/monitoring/live with JWT
    Flask->>Auth: validate JWT
    Auth-->>Flask: user identity verified
    Flask->>Monitoring: live_monitoring()
    Monitoring->>SQLite: SELECT active services
    SQLite-->>Monitoring: service list
    Monitoring->>SQLite: SELECT latest API and performance logs
    SQLite-->>Monitoring: log payloads
    Monitoring-->>Flask: paginated monitoring data
    Flask-->>Browser: 200 OK + metrics
    Browser-->>User: Render monitoring dashboard

    Note over Flask,Sla: Background monitoring loop
    Flask->>Sla: run SLA evaluation
    Sla->>SQLite: read SLA rules and recent logs
    SQLite-->>Sla: metric history
    Sla->>SQLite: INSERT SLA violation when threshold is exceeded
    SQLite-->>Sla: commit success

    Flask->>Alert: evaluate alert rules
    Alert->>SQLite: read alert rules and recent metrics
    SQLite-->>Alert: metric values
    Alert->>SQLite: INSERT alert and notification records
    SQLite-->>Alert: commit success

    User->>Browser: Request a report
    Browser->>Flask: POST /api/reports/ with report parameters
    Flask->>Auth: validate JWT
    Auth-->>Flask: user identity verified
    Flask->>Report: create_report()
    Report->>SQLite: INSERT report record
    SQLite-->>Report: report id
    Report->>Flask: generation started
    Flask-->>Browser: 201 Created
    Browser-->>User: Report queued

    Report->>SQLite: read services, logs, performance, alerts for selected period
    SQLite-->>Report: report data
    Report->>Report: generate PDF/CSV/Excel/JSON file
    Report->>SQLite: UPDATE report status and file path
    SQLite-->>Report: save complete
